From f769ef7dfca8b281ee14e855b862dfe1afbef7e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:53:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: reject unavailable explicit shell types before
 execution

An explicit shell requirement must not silently launch the default shell. Preserve ordinary discovery when shell is omitted and retain type-based lookup for supported explicit selections.
